Claude Code local transcript support
====================================
Adapted from https://github.com/NexA-LLC/claude-cli-sdk-rs
commit 679be0382b880a46e9888a1f5876a263155523c1, under MIT.
Affected: src-tauri/src/claude.rs and Claude transcript fixtures.
Adaptations: retain directory/session/subagent conventions and message field
classification only; use CodeCal's chrono, bounded incremental JSONL reader,
normalized events, SQLite cache, activity intervals, and calendar aggregation.
No CLI, transport, authentication, worktree command, conversation-chain rebuild,
full-file loading, prompt extraction, or SDK dependency is included.
No additional NexA copyright notice was present in these source files.

